{
  "_README": [
    "The six levels of Cameron's 2026-09-21 Levels Design Scheme.",
    "",
    "WRITTEN BY HAND. export_data.py never overwrites it.",
    "",
    "A stage names a TYPE from stage_types.json and overrides only what it",
    "wants to differ - who is opposite, which questions are asked, what it",
    "carries in from earlier. Everything else comes from the type, so the",
    "shape of a press conference lives in one place rather than six.",
    "",
    "Tier 0 levels are free and available from the start. Tier 1 and 2 are",
    "bought with XP in the finished game; while Cameron prices the economy",
    "by playtest they are simply all available.",
    "",
    "The opponents, constituents and questions are PLACEHOLDERS with neutral",
    "names, per CLAUDE.md: no canon character is invented here.",
    "",
    "pleases_on_win lists the organisations a finished level pleases, which",
    "is the bonus reward in the design scheme."
  ],
